# $NPM_NAME_RAW

Generator `$GENERATOR_VERSION` · JNI C/C++ module · CLI type:
`Native JNI Module` · Returned values use Promises (`await`)

**Update replaces this README. Remove deletes the complete module. Commit first.**

## Edit C or C++

```text
android/src/main/cpp/
```

Place the marker immediately before a top-level C++ definition:

```cpp
// @SupernoteExport
double add(double left, double right) {
  return left + right;
}
```

Do not write JNI symbols, registration code, loaders, or CMake entries; the
generator creates them.

## Call it

```typescript
import $MODULE_NAME_RAW from '$NPM_NAME_RAW';

const total = await $MODULE_NAME_RAW.add(20, 22);
```

```bash
supernote-module validate $NPM_NAME_RAW --build
```

Add `--verbose` when diagnosing a failed build.

